 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? You' not alone. Many people struggle with this. The key is using a moisturizer that has spf. Then look for one. Ziziphus green skin moisturizer is good. Use it morning and evening. For dry spots, use a liquefied aHA. For sun damaged skin, a hyaluronic with spf. And for oily skin, an avobe cream. Yes, mix them together in a small container. Then use the moisturizer day before so your skin feels normal. You can use a liquefied aHA on those the next day. Or a hyaluronic with spf as a top layer the following day.",
